            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/F-theory"}> F-theory
            ):
          %ul
            %li#Schwarz96
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Schwarz"}> John Schwarz
              \:
              = succeed "," do
                %em M Theory Extensions of T Duality
              = succeed "," do
                %em Frontiers in Quantum Field Theory
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9601077"} arXiv:hep-th/9601077
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1142/3245"} doi:10.1142/3245
          %p
            On the
